          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A drop in tanker and general-cargo transit through critical chokepoints constrains global shipping capacity, raises freight and insurance costs, and produces port delays that directly delay or reduce imports of commercially‑sourced drone components into the Russia–Ukraine supply ecosystem." />
