          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in maritime incidents forces urgent rerouting, increases trade/disruption-related margin calls and insurance collateral for shippers and commodity traders, and spikes short-term demand for dollar trade and pre-export finance, widening cross-currency basis spreads and funding stress." />
