          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rising rate of hostile or interdiction incidents in key sea lanes immediately raises transit delays, carrier cancellations and insurance costs, forcing Taiwanese exporters to cut shipment volumes and cadence." />
