          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased maritime disruptions delay or cancel shipment of specialized equipment and parts and discourage on‑site transfers and joint engineering visits, directly slowing cross‑border movement of technical know‑how and hardware." />
