          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter export controls or licensing restrictions on Taiwanese-origin advanced components and related tooling reduce the channels through which those parts reach intermediaries and end users, lowering the pool of drone components available to participants in the Russia–Ukraine conflict." />
