          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Frequent or large official FX interventions are often accompanied by tighter FX monitoring and controls (capital‑flow management) that directly complicate cross‑border payments, royalties and joint‑venture funding, prompting firms to scale back or slow formal technology licensing and co‑development agreements with Taiwanese partners." />
