          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Large or highly visible official FX interventions (e.g., persistent currency defense or managed depreciation) are perceived as competitive economic measures and tend to trigger reciprocal political and regulatory responses, including tighter export controls and licensing on sensitive technologies." />
