          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp adverse moves in bilateral exchange rates (an importer’s currency weakening) raise the local‑currency cost of imported critical minerals and precursors, causing buyers to curtail orders and suppliers to reallocate stock, reducing near‑term availability for high‑tech manufacturing." />
